<div class="hxl-wrap hxl-faq"><h2>A few things<br>before you start.</h2><div><details><summary>Is this sea moss gel or a powder?</summary><p>Sea moss gel customized with herbal powders. The herbs are ingredients in your gel, rather than a separate powder product.</p></details><details><summary>Will this quiz diagnose my hair loss?</summary><p>No. It helps describe your concerns and goals. It cannot establish the cause of hair loss or promise regrowth. Speak with a qualified professional about new or concerning hair changes.</p></details><details><summary>Can I order my custom blend now?</summary><p>This collection is in preview. Your final ingredients, serving directions and price will be confirmed before ordering opens.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change my answers?</summary><p>Yes. You can review and edit every answer before seeing your result, and return to your profile afterwards.</p></details></div></div>
<div class="hxl-wrap hxl-last"><small>YOUR HAIR. YOUR STARTING POINT.</small><h2>Let’s find your blend.</h2><a class="hxl-cta" href="{{ quiz_url }}">Take the hair quiz <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
